"id": "27078359745166082"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2309851355956647"}]}, "change_log": "## Update v810.01 is Live!\n\n## New Course: Omni La Costa North Course\nRedesigned by Gil Hanse, Omni La Costa's North Course blends wide fairways, rugged bunkering, and rolling California terrain into a bold championship test. \nHost of the NCAA Championships, it pairs modern strategy with classic SoCal resort golf.\n\n### Upcoming Drops:\nCelebrate the US Open with Long Island themed gear arriving tomorrow 6/18!\n- 2 Drivers\n- 2 Sets of Irons & Wedges\n- 2 Blade & Mallet Putters\n- 2 Golf Bags\n- 2 Balls\n\nAtolls Collection live 6/25!\n- 1 Driver & Woods\n- Set of Irons & Wedges\n- 1 Putter\n- 1 Shaft\n- 1 Club Grip\n- 1 Golf Bag\n- Driver & Fairway Wood Headcovers\n\nCelebrate 4th of July with the stars and stripes of USA coming for a limited time 7/2!\n- 1 Driver\n- 1 Blade and Mallet Putter\n- 1 Driver, Wood, Blade, and Mallet headcover\n\nCallaway Quantum Max Blackout Driver live 7/9!\n- 1 Callaway Quantum Max Blackout Driver\n\nWimbledon brings a new golf ball to the store 7/9!\n- 1 Golf tennis ball\n\n### Course Updates:\n- Dynasty - Fixed some reports of floating trees around Holes 4 & 8.\n- Dynasty - Hole 8 - Addressed some broken terrain collision on approach to the green.\n- St Andrews - Updated our in-game logos and green flags with their updated branding.\n\n### Quality:\n- Fixed an issue with triple bogey pickups in tournaments counting towards your Longest Putt stats.", "created_date": 1781711728, "id": "27078359745166082", "version": "810.01", "version_code": 16211, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 118}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}